{"server":"tw","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_05_beg","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_05","title":"各抒己見","storyCode":"GT-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9c49c54e4877754ea9193d6957895cef19bf8ebe1c2e13088eb2bf9690814a5b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"為了讓可蘿爾順利拿到寶藏，格拉尼選擇一人一槍駐守洞口。此時，整合運動，賞金獵人以及斯卡蒂的三方混戰也正式拉開帷幕。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"果然只有這個洞口可以出入，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。洞窟裡面雖然有很多岔路，不過村裡的大人帶我來過幾次，包括繼任村長那天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"......那個，不知道是不是我的錯覺，那邊，森林裡面的喊聲是不是更多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"再拖延下去，情況只會更加惡化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可蘿爾，你知道山洞中的道路，我想讓你馬上進入洞窟，沿著暗道去提前拿到寶藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？你是要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我留在這個洞口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？可蘿爾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"你要一個人面對那麼多的賞金獵人？太危險了！你，你這樣會——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不能幫你拿到寶藏，我既對不起村子，也辜負了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"......可我不想失去你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，這裡也不是你該逞英雄的場合......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"逞英雄又有什麼不好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"“即便心臟被敵寇的利刃刺穿，國王的騎兵亦不解下手中長槍。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我絕不會在這裡逃走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"而且可蘿爾，這不只是我一個人的戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"你也有你的戰鬥。也許你會因此遭遇危險，但只要能讓這片土地回歸平靜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我們就必須去做這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"寶藏那邊就交給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......我一個人的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"寶藏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"何況，我一定會照顧好你的。在廣場救下你之後我就已經下定決心，絕不會讓任何人再從你這奪走什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只是根頭髮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"......你明明還是一個小孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不是什麼......我只是個子不高而已啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我會和你一起行動的，格拉尼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"該死的白面具，怎麼連你們都要來礙事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"烏合之眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有資格和我們爭奪寶藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你在說什麼？這裡早就被我們占下來了，你們還是夾著尾巴滾蛋吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個角度能恰好看到南面的戰場，看來賞金獵人和整合運動已經展開了混戰。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"（接下來，無論哪一方的人接近這個洞口，我只要——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"趁他們在那邊打成一團，我們衝進去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，有個小個子站在那裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人可以通過這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"咕哇——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，全都給我讓開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在心情很差。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動"]},{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
